he story, Thomas recounts to Noah\u2014almost like a therapy session\u2014everything that happened with Emily. Noah plays a key role in helping him reconstruct his memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756920/extras/Kate.png?t=1748165777\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Kate.</strong> Thomas\u2019s coworker and secretly in love with him. She\u2019s one of his closest friends and always by his side\u2026 even when Emily appears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756920/extras/Thomas.png?t=1748165777\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Thomas.</strong> Through his eyes, we relive the past with Emily and discover why she left such a deep mark on his life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Join Thomas on a journey through his memories and uncover the truth behind this emotional, mysterious story.</strong></p>","developers":["Tortita Studio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3698050","name":"Remembering Emily"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756920/7fa941c441ffbdd5a082ca193883e6a74cbbae82/header.jpg?t=1748165777","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS 3.6<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.8GHz Dual-Core CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 260 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> OS X 10.9<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 / Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated gra